2026-10-28T17:22:53.5210795Z {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U4nFwMECkMBQ6CSQc7XuQz","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"number\": 15,\n3\t  \"url\": \"https://github.com/wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent/issues/15\",\n4\t  \"repo\": \"wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent\",\n5\t  \"title\": \"aws_athena_capacity_reservation target_dpus validation minimum should be 4, not 24\",\n6\t  \"body\": \"### Terraform and AWS Provider Version\\n\\n```console\\nTerraform v1.5.7\\non darwin_arm64\\n+ provider registry.terraform.io/hashicorp/aws v6.49.0\\n\\nYour version of Terraform is out of date! The latest version\\nis 1.15.5. You can update by downloading from https://www.terraform.io/downloads.html\\n```\\n\\n### Affected Resource(s) or Data Source(s)\\n\\naws_athena_capacity_reservation\\n\\n### Expected Behavior\\n\\nThe resource should accept target_dpus = 4, as AWS updated the minimum capacity for Athena Capacity Reservations to 4 DPUs on February 10, 2026.\\n\\n\\n### Actual Behavior\\n\\nThe provider validation rejects target_dpus = 4 with the error:\\n\\nError: Invalid Attribute Value\\n  Attribute target_dpus value must be at least 24, got: 4\\n\\nThe validation is hardcoded to >= 24, which no longer matches the AWS API.\\n\\n### Relevant Error/Panic Output\\n\\n```console\\n\\u2502 Error: Invalid Attribute Value\\n\\u2502\\n\\u2502   with aws_athena_capacity_reservation.AthenaCapacityReservation,\\n\\u2502   on main.tf line 17, in resource \\\"aws_athena_capacity_reservation\\\" \\\"AthenaCapacityReservation\\\":\\n\\u2502   17:   target_dpus = 4\\n\\u2502\\n\\u2502 Attribute target_dpus value must be at least 24, got: 4\\n```\\n\\n\\n### Sample Terraform Configuration\\n\\n<details open>\\n<summary>Click to expand configuration</summary>\\n\\n```hcl\\nresource \\\"aws_athena_capacity_reservation\\\" \\\"example\\\" {\\n  name        = \\\"example\\\"\\n  target_dpus = 4\\n}\\n```\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n### Steps to Reproduce\\n\\n1. Define an aws_athena_capacity_reservation resource with target_dpus = 4\\n2. Run terraform plan\\n3. Provider validation fails before any API call is made\\n\\n### Debug Logging\\n\\n<details open>\\n<summary>Click to expand log output</summary>\\n\\n```console\\nn/a \\u2014 the error is a provider-side validation failure, no API call is made\\n```\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n### GenAI / LLM Assisted Development\\n\\nn/a\\n\\n### Important Facts and References\\n\\nAWS announced 4 DPU minimum support on February 10, 2026:\\nhttps://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2026/02/amazon-athena-one-minute-capacity-reservations\\n\\nThe AWS console (Create capacity reservation page) also shows \\\"Minimum: 4 DPU\\\".\\n<img width=\\\"806\\\" height=\\\"569\\\" alt=\\\"Image\\\" src=\\\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed28abfe-133f-437a-9dce-992f8096a6e1\\\" />\\n\\nThe fix is to update the target_dpus validation in the provider from >= 24 to >= 4.\\n\\n### Would you like to implement a fix?\\n\\nNo\\n\",\n7\t  \"author\": \"zzzinn\",\n8\t  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n9\t  \"labels\": [\n10\t    \"bug\"\n11\t  ],\n12\t  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T17:08:26Z\",\n13\t  \"as_of\": \"2026-06-10T15:49:38Z\"\n14\t}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f5565a64-d076-4057-907b-a9a0d96fe91a","uuid":"149674ff-c234-435c-95f1-7daac1911d3c","timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:22:53.513Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/gh-aw/agent/issue.json","content":"{\n  \"number\": 15,\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent/issues/15\",\n  \"repo\": \"wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent\",\n  \"title\": \"aws_athena_capacity_reservation target_dpus validation minimum should be 4, not 24\",\n  \"body\": \"### Terraform and AWS Provider Version\\n\\n```console\\nTerraform v1.5.7\\non darwin_arm64\\n+ provider registry.terraform.io/hashicorp/aws v6.49.0\\n\\nYour version of Terraform is out of date! The latest version\\nis 1.15.5. You can update by downloading from https://www.terraform.io/downloads.html\\n```\\n\\n### Affected Resource(s) or Data Source(s)\\n\\naws_athena_capacity_reservation\\n\\n### Expected Behavior\\n\\nThe resource should accept target_dpus = 4, as AWS updated the minimum capacity for Athena Capacity Reservations to 4 DPUs on February 10, 2026.\\n\\n\\n### Actual Behavior\\n\\nThe provider validation rejects target_dpus = 4 with the error:\\n\\nError: Invalid Attribute Value\\n  Attribute target_dpus value must be at least 24, got: 4\\n\\nThe validation is hardcoded to >= 24, which no longer matches the AWS API.\\n\\n### Relevant Error/Panic Output\\n\\n```console\\n\\u2502 Error: Invalid Attribute Value\\n\\u2502\\n\\u2502   with aws_athena_capacity_reservation.AthenaCapacityReservation,\\n\\u2502   on main.tf line 17, in resource \\\"aws_athena_capacity_reservation\\\" \\\"AthenaCapacityReservation\\\":\\n\\u2502   17:   target_dpus = 4\\n\\u2502\\n\\u2502 Attribute target_dpus value must be at least 24, got: 4\\n```\\n\\n\\n### Sample Terraform Configuration\\n\\n<details open>\\n<summary>Click to expand configuration</summary>\\n\\n```hcl\\nresource \\\"aws_athena_capacity_reservation\\\" \\\"example\\\" {\\n  name        = \\\"example\\\"\\n  target_dpus = 4\\n}\\n```\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n### Steps to Reproduce\\n\\n1. Define an aws_athena_capacity_reservation resource with target_dpus = 4\\n2. Run terraform plan\\n3. Provider validation fails before any API call is made\\n\\n### Debug Logging\\n\\n<details open>\\n<summary>Click to expand log output</summary>\\n\\n```console\\nn/a \\u2014 the error is a provider-side validation failure, no API call is made\\n```\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n### GenAI / LLM Assisted Development\\n\\nn/a\\n\\n### Important Facts and References\\n\\nAWS announced 4 DPU minimum support on February 10, 2026:\\nhttps://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2026/02/amazon-athena-one-minute-capacity-reservations\\n\\nThe AWS console (Create capacity reservation page) also shows \\\"Minimum: 4 DPU\\\".\\n<img width=\\\"806\\\" height=\\\"569\\\" alt=\\\"Image\\\" src=\\\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed28abfe-133f-437a-9dce-992f8096a6e1\\\" />\\n\\nThe fix is to update the target_dpus validation in the provider from >= 24 to >= 4.\\n\\n### Would you like to implement a fix?\\n\\nNo\\n\",\n  \"author\": \"zzzinn\",\n  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n  \"labels\": [\n    \"bug\"\n  ],\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T17:08:26Z\",\n  \"as_of\": \"2026-06-10T15:49:38Z\"\n}","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01U4nFwMECkMBQ6CSQc7XuQz","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
